+// RIPPS2: view tilt. While on, every primitive is drawn rotated a few degrees about a pivot, in
+// perspective (yaw about the vertical axis, then pitch about the horizontal one), so a group of
+// theme elements -- art, glass, text glyphs, badges, a cover in its case -- tilts together. Sprites
